<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed sharply higher in heavy trading Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 96.53 to 6177.71, a record.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 5.12 to 383.55, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.54.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 1701 to 756.</p>
<p>Volume was 509,024,510, compared with 486,047,400 Tuesday.</p>
